#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:11
msgid "3 · Check the priors"
msgstr "3 · Memeriksa prior"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:13
msgid "Check that the priors produce plausible data before you fit the model."
msgstr "Periksa bahwa prior menghasilkan data yang masuk akal sebelum Anda melakukan fitting model."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:15
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You need an unfitted model from {doc}`02-specify-model`. The check samples from the priors only. It takes seconds, and the model stays unfitted."
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan model yang belum di-fit dari {doc}`02-specify-model`. Pemeriksaan ini hanya melakukan sampling dari prior. Prosesnya hanya beberapa detik, dan model tetap belum di-fit."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:20
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:35
msgid "The plot shows data simulated from the priors next to the observed data. The R-style alias `hbpc` is the same function, and `n_draws=` sets the number of simulated datasets (default 50)."
msgstr "Plot menampilkan data yang disimulasikan dari prior di samping data amatan. Alias gaya R `hbpc` adalah fungsi yang sama, dan `n_draws=` menentukan jumlah dataset simulasi (bawaan 50)."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:39
msgid "`prior.prior_summary` holds the prior distribution of each parameter:"
msgstr "`prior.prior_summary` memuat distribusi prior setiap parameter:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:45
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:47
msgid "The priors are reasonable when the simulated data:"
msgstr "Prior wajar jika data simulasi:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:49
msgid "covers the observed data;"
msgstr "menutupi data amatan;"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:50
msgid "stays on the scale of the observed data, not orders of magnitude wider;"
msgstr "berada pada skala data amatan, tidak berkali-kali lipat lebih lebar;"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:51
msgid "puts little weight on impossible values, such as a proportion outside 0 to 1."
msgstr "memberi bobot kecil pada nilai yang mustahil, misalnya proporsi di luar 0 sampai 1."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:53
#, python-format
msgid "Compare the middle 95% of the simulated values with the observed range:"
msgstr "Bandingkan 95% nilai simulasi yang di tengah dengan rentang data amatan:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:63
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The default priors simulate values from about −3 to 12 for data between 3.2 and 6.2. That is wider than the data but on the same scale, so the priors are reasonable. Continue to {doc}`04-fit-model`."
msgstr "Prior bawaan menyimulasikan nilai sekitar −3 sampai 12 untuk data antara 3,2 dan 6,2. Rentang itu lebih lebar dari data tetapi pada skala yang sama, jadi prior-nya wajar. Lanjutkan ke {doc}`04-fit-model`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:67
msgid "If the priors are not reasonable"
msgstr "Jika prior tidak wajar"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:69
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Go back to {doc}`02-specify-model`, change `priors=`, and run the check again. For example, a very wide prior on the coefficients:"
msgstr "Kembali ke {doc}`02-specify-model`, ubah `priors=`, lalu jalankan pemeriksaan lagi. Contohnya, prior yang sangat lebar pada koefisien:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:83
msgid "These priors simulate values of about ±200 for data between 3 and 6. Narrow them before fitting."
msgstr "Prior ini menyimulasikan nilai sekitar ±200 untuk data antara 3 dan 6. Persempit sebelum fitting."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:86
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:88
msgid "**`ImportError`.** The check builds the model in Bambi. Install the `bambi` extra: `pip install \"hbsaemp[bambi] @ git+https://github.com/madsyair/hbsaemp\"`."
msgstr "**`ImportError`.** Pemeriksaan ini membangun model di Bambi. Pasang extra `bambi`: `pip install \"hbsaemp[bambi] @ git+https://github.com/madsyair/hbsaemp\"`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:91
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**`DataValidationError`.** The data fails the same checks as `fit()`. See the errors in {doc}`02-specify-model`."
msgstr "**`DataValidationError`.** Data gagal dalam pemeriksaan yang sama dengan `fit()`. Lihat galat di {doc}`02-specify-model`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:94
msgid "**The plot is missing.** `prior.prior_predictive_plot` is `None` and the reason is logged as a warning. The summary table and `prior.idata` are still returned."
msgstr "**Plot tidak muncul.** `prior.prior_predictive_plot` bernilai `None` dan alasannya dicatat sebagai peringatan. Tabel ringkasan dan `prior.idata` tetap dikembalikan."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:97
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/03-check-priors.md:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why priors are checked before fitting: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."
msgstr "Mengapa prior diperiksa sebelum fitting: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."

